      <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>Disc images in more formats: besides .iso, PortWin now opens .bin/.cue, Alcohol .mdf/.mds, Nero .nrg and CloneCD .ccd/.img. Raw-sector images are converted to .iso once (audio tracks are skipped), then inserted as drive D: like a real CD.</li><li>The Disks section is always shown in a bottle, with a new “Insert Disc…” button.</li></ul>]]></description>
